    <Method Name="Clear" Id="{3fb14633-892d-4442-b75e-6b5e593146ae}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*!
<summary>Clears diagnostic state for reuse without deleting this instance.</summary>
<description>
Does not extend the lifetime of borrowed references or transfer ownership.
Concrete implementations define which metadata is reset; disposal calls must not raise exceptions.
</description>
